   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c00",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# NASA CMAPSS FD001 — Evaluación rápida del dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** Kaggle `behrad3d/nasa-cmaps` (archive/CMaps/)\n",
    "- `train_FD001.txt` — entrenamiento\n",
    "- `test_FD001.txt` — test (sin RUL conocido, se une con RUL_FD001.txt)\n",
    "- `RUL_FD001.txt` — RUL real de cada motor en test\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objetivo de este notebook:** decidir si el dataset vale la pena escalar a un proyecto final. No es un pipeline de producción — es una prueba de viabilidad."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "c01",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-18T19:08:12.298360Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-18T19:08:12.298360Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-18T19:08:15.760606Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-18T19:08:15.760606Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%matplotlib inline\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.rcParams['figure.dpi'] = 120\n",
    "sns.set_theme(style='whitegrid')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c02",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Carga de datos\n",
    "\n",
    "El dataset no tiene header. Columnas:\n",
    "- `engine_id` — identificador del motor\n",
    "- `cycle` — ciclo de operación (tiempo)\n",
    "- `setting1`, `setting2`, `setting3` — ajustes operativos\n",
    "- `s1`…`s21` — 21 sensores"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "c03",
